  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Commitment Level 2 - EU assistance to Uzbekistan Agri-Food Development Strategy 2020-2030</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Overall Objective of this action is to contribute to the development of a sustainable market-oriented and inclusive agri-food system that will increase farm income, expand livelihood opportunities and enhance food security for smallholder farmers, women and the most vulnerable groups in Uzbekistan. This is the continuation of the contract 2020/419-898 with the same title &apos;&apos;EU assistance to Uzbekistan Agri-Food Development Strategy 2020-2030&apos;&apos;.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
